01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Bokeh is a 2017 science fiction drama film written and
directed by Geoffrey Orthwein and Andrew Sullivan.

10
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It stars Maika Monroe and Matt O'Leary as two American tourists in Iceland who
find everyone else on the island has mysteriously vanished.

11
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
It premiered at the Santa Barbara International Film Festival and was
released theatrically in the United States on March 24, 2017.

12
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
